<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
    <style>
      body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
      .container { background-color: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 30px; }
      .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
      .title { color: #111827; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; }
      .content { background-color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin-bottom: 20px; }
      .credentials { background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 15px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: monospace; margin: 15px 0; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; }
      .warning { color: #b91c1c; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; }
      .button { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #2563eb; color: white !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0; }
      .section-title { font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; color: #1f2937; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 5px; }
      .list { padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
      .list li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
      .footer { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 30px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1 class="title">Welcome to ProxySock</h1>
        <p>Your premium reseller account has been created.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>Dear <%= @name %>,</p>
        <p>We are thrilled to welcome you to the ProxySock Reseller Program! Your account has been officially provisioned and is ready for use.</p>

        <p>To finalize your registration and activate your account, please confirm your email address by clicking the button below:</p>
        
        <div style="text-align: center;">
          <a href="<%= @confirmation_url %>" class="button">Confirm Email & Activate Account</a>
        </div>
        
        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; text-align: center;">This confirmation link will expire in 30 minutes.</p>

        <h3 class="section-title">Your Login Credentials</h3>
        <p>Below are your temporary login credentials. For your security, <strong>please change your password immediately</strong> upon your first login.</p>
        <div class="credentials">
          <strong>Login URL:</strong> <a href="<%= @login_url %>"><%= @login_url %></a><br>
          <strong>Email:</strong> <%= @user.email %><br>
          <strong>Password:</strong> <%= @password.present? ? @password : "(Not provided or hidden for security)" %>
        </div>
        <p class="warning">⚠️ Never share your password or API keys with anyone.</p>

        <% if @user.reseller_type == 'api_only' %>
          <h3 class="section-title">API Integration</h3>
          <p>As an <strong>API Only</strong> reseller, you have full programmatic access to our infrastructure. You can provision, manage, and scale proxies dynamically through our REST API.</p>
          <p>To get started with your integration, please review our comprehensive API documentation:</p>
          <p>👉 <a href="<%= @swagger_url %>">ProxySock Swagger API Documentation</a></p>
        <% elsif @user.reseller_type == 'single_product' %>
          <h3 class="section-title">Single Product Reselling</h3>
          <p>As a <strong>Single Product</strong> reseller, your dashboard has been streamlined and specialized for your approved product category. You have access to exclusive bulk pricing and management tools tailored specifically for your vertical.</p>
        <% elsif @user.reseller_type == 'infrastructure' %>
          <h3 class="section-title">Enterprise Infrastructure</h3>
          <p>As an <strong>Enterprise Infrastructure</strong> partner, you have unrestricted access to our full suite of products at the highest volume discounts, dedicated support, and advanced infrastructure controls.</p>
          <p>You can manage your extensive operations programmatically via our API:</p>
          <p>👉 <a href="<%= @swagger_url %>">ProxySock Swagger API Documentation</a></p>
        <% end %>

        <h3 class="section-title">Funding & Minimum Deposits</h3>
        <p>To begin provisioning orders, you will need to fund your Main Wallet. ProxySock operates on a prepaid balance system.</p>
        <ul class="list">
          <li><strong>Minimum Deposit:</strong> The minimum deposit amount required to activate purchasing capabilities is <%= number_to_currency(@user.min_deposit_amount) %> USD.</li>
          <li><strong>Payment Methods:</strong> Cryptocurrency (BTC, ETH, USDT, LTC, etc.) via Plisio, and Credit Cards via RexPay. Top up directly from your Reseller Dashboard under "Wallet & Billing" section.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="section-title">Terms of Service</h3>
        <p>By using your ProxySock Reseller account, you agree to our comprehensive Terms of Service. Key highlights include:</p>
        <ul class="list">
          <li><strong>Zero Tolerance for Abuse:</strong> Our proxies and servers strictly prohibit illegal activities, hacking, spamming, and network abuse.</li>
          <li><strong>KYC / AML:</strong> We reserve the right to request identity verification for large transactions or suspicious activity.</li>
          <li><strong>Refund Policy:</strong> Wallet top-ups are non-refundable once used to purchase services. Please refer to our site for full details.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>If you have any questions or require assistance setting up your integration, our support team is available 24/7 via the ticketing system in your dashboard.</p>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br>The ProxySock Team</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; <%= Time.current.year %> ProxySock. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
